  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Socially just and sustainable energy transitions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to build capacity and competence through education, research and outreach to secure a regional workforce with the relevant skills set and knowledge required to implement and demand for a just and sustainable low-carbon energy transition agenda. Main objectives of the project are to: develop programs, improve staff competency and capacity, produce more and better research and strengthen gender equality in education and research.</narrative>
  </description>
